@LogiTrack_HostAddress = http://localhost:5194
@token = paste_accessToken_here

### Register a regular user (no privileged roles)
POST {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Example!Pass2026"
}

### Login, then copy accessToken into @token above
POST {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Example!Pass2026"
}

### Authenticated inventory request
GET {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Authenticated orders request
GET {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manager only: replace 123 with the intended item ID
DELETE {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manager only: replace 123 with the intended order ID
DELETE {{LogiTrack_HostAddress}}/api/orders/123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}